# PrestaShop migration source data (raw CSV exports + downloaded product
# photos) - large local-only working files, never meant for the repo. The
# migration scripts already write their results straight into the live
# Neon DB and into ready-to-run mysql-*.sql files (which DO get committed).
scripts/prestashop-import/Data/

# Real product photos copied locally for the PHP/MySQL side by
# import-images.mjs - these get uploaded directly to the Jump.bg server via
# FTP/cPanel when php-site is deployed, not through git (too large, and
# git isn't the deployment mechanism for that folder).
php-site/uploads/products/

